# RealmsRPG Project

**Stack:** Next.js App Router, React, Tailwind, Supabase, Vercel. No Prisma. Schema: `SUPABASE_SCHEMA.md`.

**Dirs:** `src/app/`, `src/components/{ui,patterns,...}/`, `src/hooks/`, `src/stores/`, `src/lib/`, `src/services/`.

**Agent OS:** `ARCHITECTURE_CONSTITUTION.md` · tasks `ACTIVE_TASKS.md` · SoT map in root `AGENTS.md`.

**Delivery (default):** One Website ClickUp card + branch `task/TASK-###-slug` + PR → Collin (`CLICKUP_GITHUB_WORKFLOW.md`; MCP budget / pending flush). Owner may override.

**Before PR / push:** `npm run build` + `npm run tasks:validate`. Strict reconcile: commit subject(s) list every newly done `TASK-###`. `related_files` paths must exist. UI gates: lint/contrast/build + visual/a11y.
